00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:52.160
<i>Doujinshi are fan books written by yaoi girls,
 see. They're experts in fantasizing.</i>

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.490
<i>A novice would be left in 
tears tryin' to read one!</i>

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:55.500
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.490
<i>My mind's so messed up right now, I sound
