00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:13.660
<b>* Thin books: Slang for fan-made doujinshi</b>

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:18.280
Sorry, we don't have this one.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:19.990
It's...

